    "sub_name": "跨領域畢業專題(一)",
    "sub_ename": "INTERDISCIPLINARY GRADUATION PROJECT(1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為終端式專題課程，結合西屯區文物與科技，進行真實場域及真實情境的專題製作，培養學生主動發現、探索問題的能力，進而解決複雜問題，成為前瞻人才。",
    "describe_eh": "This project is a capstone course, combining the history, culture and digital technology of Xitun District, to produce real field and real situation project, cultivate students' ability to discover and explore problems, and further solve complex problems ,become a foresight talented person.",
